# Review Request — No Gating

**Full doctrine:** [docs/communications/review-request-no-gating-v1.md](../../docs/communications/review-request-no-gating-v1.md)

## Freeze

**ARK never gates public reviews.** Every eligible customer gets the same honest-review opportunity. Private feedback and public reviews are independent — not conditional branches.

## Do not build

- Star-first / happiness screens that route to Google vs private-only
- Sentiment-based suppression of the Google link
- Incentives or “please leave 5 stars” copy
- CSAT that decides who receives a Google review link

## Do build (when touching this surface)

- Same outbound copy for everyone: honest feedback + Google review URL from settings + Contact Us
- ConversationMessage authority — not a `review_requests` table
- CSAT only as a **separate** later intent, never a gate
